        description:
          'For `dropdown` and `multiselect` fields only; sending it for any other field type is rejected. **The array replaces the whole option\nset: every option you omit is removed, and records referencing a removed option no longer resolve a value. An empty array removes every\noption.** So list all the options you want to keep, not just the ones you are changing. `null` and `[]` do opposite things here: `null`\nis ignored and leaves the option set exactly as it is, while `[]` deletes every option — both return a 200\n',
